{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"notSupported","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On iOS, this occurs because the system NFC stack always pre-selects the national AID1"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"applet before the SDK receives the tag. The card’s security policy blocks cross-applet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"access to the ICAO applet from within an AID1 secure messaging session."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is a platform constraint, not an SDK error. Passive auth works normally on Android."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"notSupported"}],"modules":[{"name":"EidKit"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:6EidKit17PassiveAuthStatusO12notSupportedyA2CmF","roleHeading":"Case","title":"PassiveAuthStatus.notSupported","symbolKind":"case"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/eidkit\/passiveauthstatus\/notsupported"]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Passive auth could not be performed because the card’s ICAO data group files (SOD\/DG2\/DG7)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are not accessible in the current session context."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus\/notSupported"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit","doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus"]]},"references":{"doc://EidKit/documentation/EidKit":{"kind":"symbol","title":"EidKit","identifier":"doc:\/\/